# Repo-wide ignores. Per-model folders add their own .gitignore for the large,
# regenerable ADMB / SS3 run output specific to that stock -- see
# "GOA pollock/.gitignore" and "Pacific hake/.gitignore" for the pattern
# (ignore the run directory, then un-ignore by name the few files a script
# actually reads).

# --- R session and IDE state -------------------------------------------------
.Rproj.user
.Rhistory
.Rapp.history
.RData
*.RData
.Ruserdata

# --- OS and office application scratch ---------------------------------------
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
# Excel/Word lock files, e.g. "~$yfs_single_species_2022.xlsx"
~$*
# LibreOffice lock files, e.g. ".~lock.Adriatic_base.xlsx#"
.~lock.*#
*.swp

# --- Build products and scratch output ---------------------------------------
# Compiled TMB/ADMB objects and shared libraries: rebuilt from source, and
# platform-specific, so they must not be committed.
*.o
*.so
*.dll
# ADMB scratch (cmpdiff.tmp, gradfil1.tmp, varssave.tmp, amak.tmp)
*.tmp
*.rds
Rplots.pdf

# --- Oversized archives ------------------------------------------------------
# Kept on disk but too large for git.
AI cod - Dev/SS3/AI Cod.zip
